OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of hazards in farm worker
OL,4,Aaccommodation
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 300 hazards have been found
OL,7,Fin 295 units of farm worker
OL,8,Faccommodation in Jersey since May, an
OL,9,Fanswer to a written States question has
OL,10,Frevealed.
OL,12,FThe standard of farm worker
OL,13,Faccommodation was brought into focus
OL,14,Fafter an inquest into the death of a
OL,15,FFilipino farm worker found his living
OL,16,Fconditions contributed to his death.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
