OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of hazards in farm worker
OL,4,Aaccommodation
OL,5,
OL,6,FResponding to the hazards statistics,
OL,7,FPlanning Minister Mark Boleat said
OL,8,Fhazards, including mould, damp and cold
OL,9,Faccommodation, were "quite small
OL,10,Fthings" and would be found "in most
OL,11,Fpeople's homes".
OL,13,FHowever, Deputy Beatriz Poree said they
OL,14,Fwere "only minor issues if you don't
OL,15,Fhave to live in that accommodation".
